      316.39,
      292.46,
      338.24
    ],
    "text": "(e).The permit holder should not fell trees and removethem from the land or damage them in any manner,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
